  "contract": [
    "Original composer PermissionSelect and bare /permission popup share the three existing Pi modes; Full access uses original checkbox confirmation",
    "Explicit machine-id arguments are direct human choices; exact admitted SDK RPC input is required for Native/Browser commands and transformed escalation is rejected",
    "Canonical policy and revisioned display-boundary history commit atomically before accepted live memory; failed/stale/unsupported writes preserve policy/revision/bytes",
    "Current choices govern future authorization checks; lowering to Read Only after a pending approval blocks actual approved tool/job dispatch",
    "Raising to Full access does not resolve an older approval; accepted jobs retain independent grant snapshots and child modes cannot be mutated",
    "Historical Reply/Edit seed policy from the selected message and own fresh revisions/anchors; original parent bytes remain unchanged",
    "Metadata controls create no AgentSession or model request; SDK text commands add no native messages/title or model request",
    "Read snapshots page 20 policy records, legacy initial time stays unknown, and malformed history fails closed for its conversation",
    "Accepted setter receipt is authoritative; dirty notifications request reads; newer reads retire old reads without replay or losing a confirmed write",
    "Lost/stale/invalid write replies fence choices until explicit refresh; draft/scope/revision changes retire stale controls and slash consumption",
    "Scoped inspectors see only their chosen mode and cannot select; archived roots must be restored; Browser Full does not add Native tools",
    "New-chat defaults remain separate; current modes provide no OS sandbox, experimental Auto or cancellation of already dispatched work"
  ],
